{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29570","headline":"赠华阳宋真人兼寄清都刘先生 · 李商隐","name":"赠华阳宋真人兼寄清都刘先生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沦谪千年别帝宸，至今犹谢蘂珠人。\n但惊茅许同仙籍，不道刘卢是世亲。\n玉捡赐书迷凤篆，金华归驾冷龙鳞。\n不因杖屦逢周史，徐甲何曾有此身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29570.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29570","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}